        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-prepositions-p12-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "作为 + role",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "作为 introduces the role or capacity relevant to a judgment or action. It does not necessarily mean becoming that role.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "作为老师，我要帮助学生。",
                "pinyin": "zuòwéi lǎoshī ， wǒ yào bāngzhù xuéshēng 。",
                "meaning": "As a teacher, I need to help students.",
                "audio": "9f84d30c7a2813846c55860fc3c0eaffd57d832d0564c93b9c69fba689cb1996"
              },
              {
                "text": "作为朋友，我理解你。",
                "pinyin": "zuòwéi péngyou ， wǒ lǐjiě nǐ 。",
                "meaning": "As your friend, I understand you.",
                "audio": "1ca6f31d59700c9c77ffcc5fbe026b89bb1c869c39d3fee0a242fbd8f2904e4b"
              }
            ]
          },
